<section class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 pt-4 sm:pt-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-16">
    <section>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight">
        I’m Javad Effat Doost — a developer, maker, and lifelong table tennis learner.
      </h1>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight pb-4 pt-5">What I Do</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
        <p>
          My work sits at the intersection of technology, design, and a lifelong passion for table tennis. I build digital products and tools that are simple, elegant, and effective, guided by a philosophy of creating things that I personally want to use. My mission is to craft experiences that are not only functional but also honest and delightful, stripping away the unnecessary to focus on what truly matters.
        </p>
        <p>
          From developing intuitive software solutions to innovating within the table tennis community, every project is an opportunity to learn, refine my craft, and contribute something of value. I believe in quiet confidence, transparent processes, and the power of sustained effort over time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight pb-4 pt-5">Now</h2>
      <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
        <p>
          I’m currently focused on building ScoutSpin, a platform designed to help table tennis players analyze their game and improve faster. It’s the culmination of my love for the sport and my expertise in software development.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight pb-6 pt-5">My Ecosystem</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <%= link_to "https://buildcue.com", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener",
              class: "flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors" do %>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent">construction</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold">Buildcue</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-subtle-light">Software Development</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>

        <%= link_to "https://scoutspin.com", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener",
              class: "flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors" do %>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent">sports_tennis</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold">ScoutSpin</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-subtle-light">Table Tennis Analytics</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>

        <%= link_to "https://www.youtube.com/@Javaded", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener",
              class: "flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors" do %>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent">smart_display</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold">YouTube Channel</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-subtle-light">Content &amp; Tutorials</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
